        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Serubabel okoku loka Sealutiel, ka Yosua okoku loka Yekosadak, esasedoti lopeti, ka luedeuna kotuna, arimar eporoto loka EJAKAIT Ekecedeke, ka akiro nuka Kagai enabi, kwape abu EJAKAIT Ekecedeke kijukaria ŋes; koyonata ituŋa EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
          }
